@layer kp.components {
    /* --- Version jump chip: "10.11 → 12.1" [kpadopt6-ops] ---
 * `.kp-badge.kp-badge--version` (js/version-delta.js). The old version is struck and lighter, the new one strong and, when it
 * has release notes, a link; a jump that needs care adds the word "major" with a "!" in a ring, so the risk is never colour
 * alone, and takes the warning tone (a version that went back, the destructive one). A quiet chip stays plain on purpose.
 * Long versions break after a dot, a hyphen or an underscore and the chip grows to hold them; on a phone it wraps under its
